================================================================================
2. DATA — see per-source terms
================================================================================

Applies to `data/raw/` and `data/processed/`.

OpenStreetMap extracts and any derived database in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
© OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL)
v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The building footprints and points of interest under `data/raw/` are extracted
from OpenStreetMap and are committed to this repository. The candidate sites,
demand grid, and distance matrices the pipeline writes to `data/processed/` are
a **Derivative Database** of that extract and are likewise offered under ODbL
1.0, whether or not a given copy of this repository ships them. Share-alike is
satisfied by this repository being public with the source extract committed and
the code that derives everything else included in full.

Full attribution: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Singapore government datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The SCDF Public Access AED registry snapshot and the URA MP2019 Planning Area
and Subzone boundaries are used under the Singapore Open Data Licence:
https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence

These datasets are a historical snapshot. Nothing in this repository is a live
copy of, or an integration with, the national AED registry.

================================================================================
3. THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
================================================================================

This repository depends on open-source libraries (GeoPandas, Shapely, PyProj,
H3, OSMnx, NumPy, pandas, SciPy, PuLP with the CBC solver, scikit-learn,
Streamlit, pydeck/deck.gl, Altair and others). Their source is not redistributed
here — they are installed from their own distributions and remain governed by
their own licences and copyright. Pinned versions are listed in
`requirements.txt` and `uv.lock`; each project's licence applies to that project.

Basemap tiles used by the application are provided by CARTO, with map data
© OpenStreetMap contributors, under their respective terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Per-source dataset ids, dates, checksums, and the fields used from each are
recorded in `docs/sources.md` and `data/manifest.json`. Development of this
project was AI-assisted; see the Acknowledgements section of `README.md`.
